Package: swapseqr
Title: Detect Swapped and Mislabelled Samples in Longitudinal Microbiome Studies
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mankirat", "Singh", , "msinghsandal@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-3375-2123"))
Description: R interface to SwapSeq. Checks whether each sample came from the subject on its label, using each subject's microbial fingerprint, and reports swapped tubes, mislabelled samples and sample-sheet shifts.
